{"title":"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Four circles of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are arranged as shown.  Their centers are the vertices of a square.  The area of the shaded region is closest to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/9/2993624e51e3a6603dd60630eadad79dacead787.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] fill((3,3)--(3,-3)--(-3,-3)--(-3,3)--cycle,lightgray); fill(arc((3,3),(0,3),(3,0),CCW)--(3,3)--cycle,white); fill(arc((3,-3),(3,0),(0,-3),CCW)--(3,-3)--cycle,white); fill(arc((-3,-3),(0,-3),(-3,0),CCW)--(-3,-3)--cycle,white); fill(arc((-3,3),(-3,0),(0,3),CCW)--(-3,3)--cycle,white);  draw(circle((3,3),3)); draw(circle((3,-3),3)); draw(circle((-3,-3),3)); draw(circle((-3,3),3)); draw((3,3)--(3,-3)--(-3,-3)--(-3,3)--cycle); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/e/f4ec83fdcb6bd138079f2f4edfd59d0176a8d562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 7.7 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 12.1 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 17.2 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"409\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The square has side length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so its area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The unshaded region inside the square consists of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> quarter-circles of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so it has the same area as a circle of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2eddbf4a36b15c84cd5a99fb11d9817bc2978d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9\\pi$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the shaded area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/3/013b7cab588e3e6ac47d305322c16e6d91d8771d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36 - 9\\pi \\approx 36 - 9 (3.14) = 7.74$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"239\" height=\"20\" />, which is closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/755a0788746a4e56f9d9ea85b4af79c199a9f1e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 7.7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME\" title=\"1992 AJHSME\">1992 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Proble